OL,4,CThrift shop asks shoppers to nominate  
OL,5,Ca charity                              
OL,6,GShoppers and donors at a new charity   
OL,7,Gshop will be able to help decide which 
OL,8,Gorganisations benefit from the money   
OL,9,Git raises.                             
OL,11,FTwisted Sisters Thrift Store, in       
OL,12,FTunstall opened last week, and is      
OL,13,Finviting customers to nominate causes  
OL,14,Fthey would like to support, with a     
OL,15,Fdifferent charity set to receive       
OL,16,Fdonations each month.                  
OL,18,FOwner Julie Rindam said the idea came  
OL,19,Fafter the closure of a charity shop;   
OL,20,Fshe had run for eight years.           
